# Arm-T runtime: the explicit input pins. The RESOLVED output is armT-lock.txt, which is the
# artifact v2.1 §0 cites and the thing that gets rebuilt from.
#
# Two donors, and a rule for who wins where they collide:
#
#   OPTIMIZATION / LM / RETRIEVAL PATH  ->  the probe donor (scratch/hover_probe/.venv), because
#   that is the environment Stage 1 actually ran in. Arm B is supposed to reproduce Stage-1 cost
#   and behaviour, and litellm is where cost accounting and retry/backoff live, so litellm and
#   openai are pinned DOWN to the Stage-1 versions rather than left at whatever a fresh dspy
#   install pulls.
#
#   EMBEDDING STACK  ->  the screen donor, at the versions the previous .venv-armT carried, because
#   those are the versions under which the two $0 acceptance gates passed: cross-venv embedding
#   equivalence (bitwise identical, max|delta| = 0.0) and the 235/235 novelty byte-verification
#   against the screen's features.csv. Those measurements are the evidence; the version numbers are
#   just their label.
#
#   COLLISION: tokenizers. Probe carries 0.23.1, the embedding stack 0.22.2. The embedding stack
#   wins -- transformers 5.13.0 constrains it, the byte-verification ran under it, and litellm's own
#   requirement is tokenizers>=0.21.0,<1.0, which 0.22.2 satisfies. tokenizers is not on the
#   optimization path.
#
# Python 3.12.13 (uv cpython-3.12-macos-aarch64-none), the same base both donors were built from.
# The screen donor is Python 3.14.3 with numpy 2.5.1; armT stays 3.12.13 / numpy 2.5.0 per §0, and
# the cross-venv gate is what certifies that the difference does not move the embeddings.

# ---- optimizer + task path (probe donor versions, v2.1 §0) ----
gepa==0.0.27
dspy==3.2.1
litellm==1.90.1
openai==2.44.0
numpy==2.5.0

# ---- retrieval (probe donor; absent from the pre-lockfile armT, which is why it could not run) ----
bm25s==0.3.9
PyStemmer==3.1.0
orjson==3.11.9

# ---- embedding stack (screen donor, v2.1 §0) ----
sentence-transformers==5.6.0
torch==2.13.0
transformers==5.13.0
tokenizers==0.22.2
huggingface_hub==1.23.0
safetensors==0.8.0
